{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123077","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123077/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123077/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123077/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123077","id":5314734221,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABByCq2A","number":123077,"title":"Core vectors: Prefer data pointer over first element addresses","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-09-01T17:16:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T00:17:18Z","closed_at":"2026-09-01T19:31:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123077","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123077","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123077.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123077.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nSome vectors in core have their pointers get with `&vec[0]` instead of `ptr()` or `ptrw()`:\r\n```cpp\r\nconst uint8_t *evptr = &existing_vector[0];\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen it should usually be like this:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nconst uint8_t *evptr = existing_vector.ptr();\r\n```\r\n---\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditionally, many `Vector`s in core have these weird patterns:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nVector<uint8_t> my_vector;\r\nmy_vector.resize(my_size);\r\nuint8_t *w = my_vector.ptrw();\r\ndo_something_with_pointer(&w[0]); // Asking a pointer for its first member address (a.k.a. itself)?\r\n```\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nint *evr = existing_vector.ptrw();\r\nuint32_t *evptr = (uint32_t *)&evr[0]; // Again, why?\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen they could be literally these:\r\n```cpp\r\nVector<uint8_t> my_vector;\r\nmy_vector.resize(my_size);\r\ndo_something_with_pointer(my_vector.ptrw());\r\n```\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nuint32_t *evptr = (uint32_t *)existing_vector.ptrw();\r\n```\r\n\r\nI've looked for as many cases as these in core, and changed them to keep code less noisy. Should not affect performance (at least not in any optimization level other than `o0` where it should be insignificant).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nOn cases where a `Vector` only exists within a function body and isn't returned, I've replaced with a `LocalVector`. Vectors that are class members were kept out of scope.\r\n\r\nThese cases also happen outside core, but not only it would make the PR massive, it would also touch separate areas that are sensitive to changes.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123077/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123077/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}